// design.md §10 Cleanup with `defer` and `errdefer`: a loop written inside the cleanup block may use `break` and `continue` on itself.
fn main() {
    {
        defer {
            for i in 0..5 { if i == 1 { continue; } if i == 3 { break; } println(f"c {i}"); }
        }
        println("body");
    }
}
